">6 actions</span></div></button><div class=" useView-module__vOh_Ha__view ExpandableContent-module__pbPZ1a__root ExpandableContent-module__pbPZ1a__disableFade"><div class=" useView-module__vOh_Ha__view ExpandableContent-module__pbPZ1a__inner"></div></div></div></div><div class=" useView-module__vOh_Ha__view Agent2FeedRow-module__MNyDAa__feedRow" style="--useView--gap: 4px; --Agent2FeedRow--feed-row-max-width: 600px; --Agent2FeedRow--feed-row-horizontal-gutter: 0px; --Agent2FeedRow--feed-row-min-height: 34px;"><div class=" useView-module__vOh_Ha__view AgentMessageBlock-module__262L_G__content" style="--useView--pt: 6px; --useView--pr: 4px; --useView--pb: 6px; --useView--pl: 4px;"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 Markdown-module__eSbD4q__markdownTheme"><p>Typecheck passes clean â€” zero errors, all workflows running. Here's what was built:</p>
<hr class="my-6 border-border" data-streamdown="horizontal-rule">
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Feature 1 â€” Soft Delete / Recycle Bin</span></p>
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:pl-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Delete is now non-destructive</span>: clicking Delete on any entry sets <code class="CodeRenderer2-module__jfz9nq__inline">isDeleted: true</code> + <code class="CodeRenderer2-module__jfz9nq__inline">deletedAt</code> timestamp in Firestore instead of removing the document. Existing entries without <code class="CodeRenderer2-module__jfz9nq__inline">isDeleted</code> continue to work normally.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">All views automatically exclude deleted entries</span>: Dashboard, All Work, Pending, and Reports only show active documents â€” handled in <code class="CodeRenderer2-module__jfz9nq__inline">subscribeToWorkEntries</code> with a client-side filter, so no Firestore index changes needed.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">New "Deleted Items" page</span> (<code class="CodeRenderer2-module__jfz9nq__inline">/deleted</code>) shows all soft-deleted entries sorted by most recently deleted, with customer name, mobile, category, amount, work date, and deletion timestamp.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Restore button</span> on each entry flips <code class="CodeRenderer2-module__jfz9nq__inline">isDeleted</code> back to <code class="CodeRenderer2-module__jfz9nq__inline">false</code> and removes <code class="CodeRenderer2-module__jfz9nq__inline">deletedAt</code>, returning it to the active lists immediately.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Deleted Items</span> is now in the sidebar navigation (with a trash icon).</li>
</ul>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Feature 2 â€” Today's Pending Reminders</span></p>
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:pl-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">New section at the <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">very top of the Dashboard</span>, always the first thing visible after login.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Shows all pending entries that are <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">3+ days old</span> (amber) or <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">7+ days old</span> (red), plus any with an outstanding due amount.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Each row shows customer name, mobile, category, days-pending badge, and due amount.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">"Mark Completed" button</span> directly on each reminder row â€” updates status to Completed in one tap without navigating away.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">When no urgent items exist, shows a green "No urgent pending work today â€” great job!" message instead.</li>
</ul>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Feature 3 â€” Category-wise Pending Summary</span></p>
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:pl-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Added to the top of the <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Pending Work page</span> as a visual chip/pill bar.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Every pending category is shown with a count badge and a mini bar-chart indicator showing relative volume.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Clicking a category chip filters</span> the list below to show only that category â€” clicking again clears the filter. A "Clear filter Ã—" chip also appears when a filter is active.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Chips and the dropdown select stay in sync.</li>
</ul></div></div></div><div class=" useView-module__vOh_Ha__view Agent2FeedRow-module__MNyDAa__feedRow" style="--useView--gap: 4px; --Agent2FeedRow--feed-row-max-width: 600px; --Agent2FeedRow--feed-row-horizontal-gutter: 0px; --Agent2FeedRow--feed-row-min-height: 34px;"></div><div class=" useView-module__vOh_Ha__view Agent2FeedRow-module__MNyDAa__feedRow" style="--useView--gap: 4px; --Agent2FeedRow--feed-row-max-width: 600px; --Agent2FeedRow--feed-row-horizontal-gutter: 0px; --Agent2FeedRow--feed-row-min-height: 34px;"><div class=" useView-module__vOh_Ha__view ChipExpandable-module__Ma1GwW__root"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-busy="false" data-react-aria-pressable="true" class=" useView-module__vOh_Ha__view useView-module__vOh_Ha__isHorizontal ChipExpandable-module__Ma1GwW__trigger Interactive2-module__BR3hWq__shades Interactive2-module__BR3hWq__root Interactive2-module__BR3hWq__transition Interactive2-module__BR3hWq__disabled _sdz_text _sdz_surface-bg _sdz_custom-hover:shades-up-2 _sdz_custom-pressed:shades-up-3 Interactive2-module__BR3hWq__borderRadius Interactive2-module__BR3hWq__focus" style="--useView--gap: 6px; --useView--justify: space-between; --useView--align: center; --useView--pt: 4px; --useView--pr: 4px; --useView--pb: 4px; --useView--pl: 4px; --Interactive2--border-radius: 12px;"><div class=" useView-module__vOh_Ha__view useView-module__vOh_Ha__isHorizontal" style="--useView--gap: 8px; --useView--align: center; --useView--grow: 1; --useView--shrink: 1; --useView--wrap: wrap;"><div class=" useView-module__vOh_Ha__view _sdz_surface-bg _sdz_surface _sdz_surface-border _sdz_surface-border-strength-subtle ToolUsePrimitives-module__A3-RwW__iconSurface" style="--useView--justify: center; --useView--align: center; --useView--pt: 4px; --useView--pr: 4px; --useView--pb: 4px; --useView--pl: 4px; --useView--border-radius: var(--border-radius-8);"><svg preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMin" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="var(--foreground